DTEND:20260620T125900Z
SUMMARY:WACV 2027 · Round 1 new-paper enrollment deadline
DESCRIPTION:IEEE/CVF Winter Conference on Applications of Computer Vision\n
 Meeting: 2027-01-06 to 2027-01-08\, Lake Buena Vista\, Florida\, USA\nSta
 tus: confirmed\, checked 2026-10-07\nFormat: Paper-based / two independen
 t submission rounds\nOfficial source: https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences
 /2027/CallForPapers\nVenue Radar: https://gon-uri.github.io/venue-radar/#
 wacv-2027\nNotes: Official CFP confirms separate enrollment gates for bot
 h new-paper rounds at 23:59 AoE. Both are already closed despite the futu
 re camera-ready deadline. Main conference is January 6-8 at Disney Spring
 s\; workshops run January 4-5. XL is an editorial estimate\, not an accep
 tance-rate proxy.
CATEGORIES:Computer Vision & Pattern Recognition,Machine Learning,Deep Repr
 esentation Learning
URL:https://wacv.thecvf.com/Conferences/2027/CallForPapers
END:VEVENT
